WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
1 / Assemble the silicon–oxygen tetrahedron
Four oxygen atoms surround one silicon. The 3D arrangement is a tetrahedron.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:26.000
2 / Build a single chain by sharing oxygen
Tetrahedra link by sharing corner oxygen atoms. Changing connectivity builds chains, sheets and frameworks.
